# FRQ_SEQ  1.4   Format version 2023.06.03
#
#  Frequency sequence used by Haystack in 2017-2024
#
#  Astronomical convention is used for band definition
#  For instance notation 2004.1 32.0 means the band
#  that covers range [2004.1, 2036.1] MHz
#
#  Last updated by L. Petrov on 2025.11.25_14:25:03
#
#  The sequence suggested by Haystack for VGOS experiments
#
MOD_NAME  g01
HDS_NAME  h1
#
#       station       wiring name
#
STATION GGAO12M   Gs  udc_01
STATION KOKEE12M  K2  udc_01
STATION MACGO12M  Mg  udc_01
STATION WESTFORD  Wf  udc_01
#
#  Bnd Low_frq bandwidh  IF Order (dir/inv)
#
